<body>
    <h1>Introduction</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"87679f7b-7118-405c-987b-4673b65de331"></p>
<p local-id=3D"1c65d6203f15">Text in <span style=3D"color: rgb(7,71,166);">=
blue </span>is quoted from RP1745, section x.9.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a22d3fefa091">Where necessary, the source is redacted to com=
ply with BIX paradigm: no batching of items (multiple bags), no report over=
 a collection of actions. BIX reports an event, outcome of a single process=
 step for a single item.</p>
<p local-id=3D"59177ce6d310">The sample thus obtained in rp1745 rendering i=
s mapped to xml (and future json) rendering. Except when sample is a trivia=
l duplication of earlier work. Trivial samples are dropped.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a70c6871bb1e">Text in black is added to illustrate extractio=
n and mapping process</p>
<p local-id=3D"03a3f9702387">For reference</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2bf29099-45fa-478a-b4ae-c128e3095c3e">
<li local-id=3D"101ffd00-a9e4-4438-8acd-1854822fe6c5">
<p local-id=3D"877f8d4c51fc"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://iat=
aonline.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/IATABaggageWorkingGroup/Shared%20Documen=
ts/General/PSCRM%20Word%20Files/PSCRM%2045u1_word%20files/pscrm-1745-en.doc=
x?d=3Dw70cb0e27ddbf4d568713581e3e0f8554&amp;csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DetY=
hCN" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>RP1745</u></a></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6718e9c0-d958-4a1c-b885-89822c680daf">
<p local-id=3D"db04f9393673"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://air=
techzone.iata.org/bix/#xsd-viewer" rel=3D"nofollow"><u>BIX-viewer</u></a></=
p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"5f0fbd05-3f2a-4983-a10a-ba233aff47f6">
<p local-id=3D"310eb1f7a0d5"><a href=3D"https://standards.atlassian.net/wik=
i/spaces/bwg/pages/2502459397/draft+Mapping+1745+to+BIX" data-linked-resour=
ce-id=3D"2502459397" data-linked-resource-version=3D"10" data-linked-resour=
ce-type=3D"page">Mapping 1745 to BIX</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"6432c7f0bdef" id=3D"Introduction-RulestorespectinmappingRP1=
745(documentoriented)toBIX(eventoriented)">Rules to respect in mapping RP17=
45 (document oriented) to BIX (event oriented)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"701296474195" id=3D"Introduction-Singleinstance">Single ins=
tance</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"03387c5f-2668-43ed-b280-4ddf81c21449">
<li local-id=3D"c19bf9cd-af50-457d-9a7d-c354f47c6b72">
<p local-id=3D"e291b5b5d75b">an event occurs to a bag or a cart or an ULD, =
not to a collection of such objects</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ce7015aa-f728-4a80-98c3-5f6fa935f49f">
<p local-id=3D"6380ca192359">event in BIX may refer to larger context (a ba=
g is placed into ULD) but BIX does not document contents of a larger item (=
list of bags in cart is excluded by design, that is document-style)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"840b2f5e88a1" id=3D"Introduction-Activetransportationsegmen=
t">Active transportation segment</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"916877bf-72de-43a9-a4e0-bfe9346b8b69">
<li local-id=3D"0e97104c-767b-472e-9cb3-285fdef9e7dc">
<p local-id=3D"3737aa7b62b6">RP1745 messages indicate transportation in .I,=
 .F and .O elements. Either .I or .F is the active segment, the focal point=
 for current bag activity.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"71cb74f7bfb8">
<p local-id=3D"33527eefd964">Rule of thumb: baggage source in .V element de=
termines active flight. For baggage source equal to L or T, active flight i=
s in .F; For baggage source equal to X, active flight is in .I.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0b019351ee3a">
<p local-id=3D"91c1bfaf01ed">Exception: BTM. Baggage source=3DT, active seg=
ment is in .I; (per upcoming Reflighting Reso 755: Baggage Source=3DE, acti=
ve segment is in .F)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"a97187a5bdf9" id=3D"Introduction-IgnoreRP1745contentoutside=
businesspayload">Ignore RP1745 content outside business payload</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"723efb80-b2d4-48db-88ef-44bb92bf530f">
<li local-id=3D"ec8c3209-89f2-4494-b9e2-9b0131bb7bb8">
<p local-id=3D"2845f0c8aed3">RP1745 examples may include addressing (TTY to=
, from timestamp) and acknowledgment/encryption requests. These aspects are=
 outside payload mapping exercise</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1adbf9637e52"></p>
<p local-id=3D"a7b582855156">Table of content at each page with examples se=
parates the samples in (typically)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"87bee1eb95d7">
<li local-id=3D"dac34383456e">
<p local-id=3D"96b824355184">mapping is provided (Processed)</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"fe6458e23f5b">
<p local-id=3D"78bcd2639fb5">mapping will be provided pending completion of=
 a change request (Pending Change Request)</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"31a111576fac">
<p local-id=3D"b60c34ddb587">mapping is not provided -when page is ready- (=
Dropped as example) or mapping is not yet provided -work in progress- (To b=
e Processed)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"df6ad6a4-5120-43ff-8d84-299948cb4df8"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
